Berry game is a kids math game of differing levels of difficulty. 

No math mode is just a game where you collect berries as they appear on the screen. 

Easy, medium, and hard math modes will consist of prompting math questions and a variety of answers that the user will need to see which one is correct.

Stack:
- HTML & CSS for structure + style
- Vanilla JavaScript for dynamic animations
- Node JS to communicate the database with the frontend  
- PostgreSQL for storing the math questions which the front end will prompt
- Docker for containerizing the processes and starting up the images
